<br><br>

The dark-haired <<person1>><<personsimple>> picks up <<his>> bag and starts gathering the contents. "Th-thank you," <<person1>><<he>> stutters. "I-I'm—" <<He>> looks at you, but blushes and looks away. "I'm Kylar." You thought <<he>> was younger than you, but <<he>> seems the same age.
